- *Soundness of experiments*: Moderate — comprehensive but limited to linear SDEs in multi-dimensional setting; diffusion dependence limitation inadequately explained.
- *Clarity*: Good — well-structured; the distinction between different CI test variants (⊥_sym, ⊥⁺, ⊥°) is navigated clearly.
- *Value to community*: Good — the CI test itself has independent value for functional data applications.

